tweets.text:
Working with Indiana State police as part of Operation Midway Blitz, we arrested 223 illegal aliens along Northwest Indiana highways since mid-September to clear the state’s roadways of illegal aliens who create safety risks.

Many of the illegal aliens’ CDLs were from states with sanctuary policies, including California, Illinois and New York.

@DHSgov

